msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_4417591F_F8D3_4566_8CD4_E398130364EE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫A tale of a foolish, naïve girl. ⟪k:1⟫Looking back on it now, I’m ashamed of everything."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫那是一个，⟪k:1⟫充满了浅薄与愚蠢的故事。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫现在回想起来……⟪k:4⟫一切都令我感到羞愧。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_62A4C95B_B77B_4B2F_AB08_0BCB011C5AAB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c1d55d5177704e192b35bda0da1b6ad50f7389e848a1d3197c0d624b92717b9f
