msgstr "⟪k:0⟫请务必……⟪k:1⟫不要放开我的手……"

#: scenario6:scenario6_CA195F44_E69A_47A7_8596_4880D7E9C30E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5d95ef48db081b98b831d09aa0c83bb6fc3416f59ce5b32b0eeab640b40ee0b1
