"⟪k:0⟫I lived as a human for twenty-one years.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫After spending nearly ten times that "
"trapped in the mansion,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫我作为普通人度过的岁月，就只有二十一年。⟪k:1⟫之后数十倍的时光，是在这个阴暗的馆里度过的……"

#: scenario6:scenario6_53372CA9_967F_44A9_BF1F_0809AC8B36E2
