"⟪k:0⟫Had I actually had a family? ⟪k:1⟫Had there actually been other people in the world? ⟪k:2⟫"
"Did cities and villages really exist?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫——我真的有过家人吗？⟪k:1⟫这个世界上真的有人类存在吗？⟪k:2⟫小镇也好，⟪k:3⟫村子也罢，⟪k:4⟫真的"
"存在吗？"

#: scenario6:scenario6_C96E264F_35B6_4BC1_9925_FAED66F2855B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c8ff9ac3e784778e590a5fd2c75ea0115653663c1acd33069db3e899cb27e6f2
