msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Was there ever ⟪k:1⟫really⟪k:2⟫ a time when light shone through the windows—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫when "
"we were happy?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫——我在那曾洒满温暖阳光的洋馆里，⟪k:1⟫幸福欢笑的那些日子……⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫——真的存在过吗……？"

#: scenario6:scenario6_A336DA9B_8D8D_46E8_8E79_6EF6DF0DC9EC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 13c8bd1a8ee75d41c069a0e8b307dbb7484aaefef4b127aa6a63dc015ab2a717
