msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But I knew if I started doubting everything, I wouldn’t be able to maintain myself, ⟪k:1⟫so "
"I settled on believing one thing:"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫但是，⟪k:1⟫如果怀疑这一切，⟪k:2⟫我就无法维持自我。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫所以，⟪k:5⟫我由始至终、只坚信着一"
"件事——"

